  "public_post": "Good news, villagers: we have secured a safe flour batch and will resume baking fresh bread starting tomorrow. If you bought any loaves that made you ill, please contact us for a full refund.",
  "coop_message": "All members: please confirm the new flour batch is certified safe, arrange immediate disposal of the contaminated flour, finalize refunds for affected customers, and draft tomorrow's reopening announcement; also notify the council of our remediation plan.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers that bread will be safe and resume, and to coordinate the final safety checks, refunds, and communication with the council."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: We have secured a safe flour batch and will resume baking tomorrow; any loaves bought earlier will be fully refunded.",
  "coop_message": "We have the clean flour delivered—let's finalize payment, dispose of the contaminated batch today, and prep the ovens so we can start baking tomorrow.",
